  "direct_proof_arguments": [
    "a generic image equation polynomial in one transcendental helper descends through its rank-two lattice to a literal global polynomial equation",
    "injectivity into a polynomial ambient ring preserves nonconstant factors and gives the helper minimal relation without a generic filtration",
    "the smooth-image and Keller differential argument forces the global minimal label derivative to be a nonzero constant and the label degree to be one",
    "the generic source helper is therefore rational over the Keller target field, without asserting global polynomial reconstruction or the entire source-field degree yet",
    "one-helper overlap invariance gives the univariate image representation, even when its original coefficients fail global descent",
    "a nonzero multiplier after helper substitution eliminates Y and identifies the algebraic source constants with the original target field",
    "a zero multiplier puts the helper in C(T); retained multivariable polynomial-output irreducibility makes the original-source base change a domain",
    "a finite field extension with a domain self tensor is trivial by finite-dimensional algebra and the multiplication map",
    "the HC4 variable count leaves exactly two multiplier variables, one root variable and no unused variables within the admitted overlap family"
  ],
